<title>NETHERLANDS: PHILIPS MOVES MALAYSIA AUDIO PLANT TO CHINA.</title>
<headline>PHILIPS MOVES MALAYSIA AUDIO PLANT TO CHINA.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Friday it planned to move the activities of its audio plant in Penang, Malaysia to China.    </p>
<p>Philips said the activities in Malaysia would be stopped in the first quarter of 1998, affecting around 1,500 jobs.</p>
<p>The activities will move to Shenzhen in southern China. Philips did not give any details of the expansion there.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
